@host = http://localhost:5171

### Create a Rental Booking for Customer 1 (UC-02)
POST {{host}}/tenant/1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "dressDescription": "Emerald Velvet Evening Gown (Size M)",
  "rentalStartDate": "2026-09-20T10:00:00Z",
  "rentalEndDate": "2026-09-23T18:00:00Z",
  "rentalFee": 150.00,
  "securityDeposit": 50.00,
  "bookingStage": "Reserved",
  "agreedToTerms": true,
  "bookingDetails": [
    {
      "rentalItemId": 1,
      "alterationNotes": "Shorten hem by 0.5 inches."
    }
  ]
}

### Get All Bookings for Tenant 1
GET {{host}}/tenant/1/bookings
Accept: application/json